OL,5,G0345 Yorkshire with Jane McDonald
OL,6,     FJane's off to Scarborough, where
OL,7,     Fshe used to come here on family
OL,8,     Fday trips when she was growing up.
OL,9,     FJoin Jane as she retraces her
OL,10,     Fsteps.
OL,11,G0430 Yorkshire with Jane McDonald
OL,12,     FJane starts out in Hawes, the
OL,13,     Fpretty market town of Upper
OL,14,     FWensleydale in the Yorkshire Dales
OL,15,     FNational Park, where she visits an
OL,16,     Fold-fashioned sweet shop.
OL,17,G0520 Entertainment News on 5
OL,18,G0525 Ben and Holly's Little Kingdom
OL,19,     FThe Little Kingdom and all of the
OL,20,     Fdads are given the day off work to
OL,21,     Fgo and play together in the
OL,22,     Fmeadow.
